      "reply": "**Given**\n\n$R = 0.2\\,\\mathrm{m}$\n\n$r = 0.04\\,\\mathrm{m}$\n\n**Find**\n\n$MA$\n\n**Formula**\n\nIdeal mechanical advantage of a wheel and axle:\n\n$MA = \\frac{R}{r}$\n\nAssumption: friction is neglected.\n\n**Substitution**\n\n$MA = \\frac{0.2}{0.04}$\n\n**Answer**\n\n```answer\n5\n```\n"
