    "incline_sliding": {
      "question": "For the 12 kg crate on a 30 degree incline with μs = 0.45 and μk = 0.30, does it start sliding?",
      "answer": "Yes, it starts sliding.",
      "reply": "**Given**\n\n$\\theta = 30^\\circ$\n\n$g = 9.81\\,\\mathrm{m/s²}$\n\n$\\mu_s = 0.45$\n\n$m = 12\\,\\mathrm{kg}$\n\n**Find**\n\n$\\text{Will it start sliding?}$\n\n**Formula**\n\nStatic-friction threshold:\n\n$F_{g,\\parallel}=mg\\sin\\theta$\n\n$f_{s,\\max} = \\mu_sN$  \n$f_{s,\\max} = \\mu_smg\\cos\\theta$\n\n$F_{g,\\parallel}>f_{s,\\max} \\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad mg\\sin\\theta>\\mu_smg\\cos\\theta$\n\n**Substitution**\n\n$F_{g,\\parallel} = 12\\cdot9.81\\cdot\\sin(30^\\circ)$  \n$F_{g,\\parallel} \\approx 58.86\\,\\text{N}$\n\n$f_{s,\\max} = 0.45\\cdot12\\cdot9.81\\cdot\\cos(30^\\circ)$  \n$f_{s,\\max} \\approx 45.88\\,\\text{N}$\n\n$58.86\\,\\text{N} > 45.88\\,\\text{N}$\n\n**Answer**\n\n```answer\n\\text{Yes, it starts sliding.}\n```\n"
    },
    "projectile_parts": {
      "question": "A projectile is launched at 20 m/s at 30 degrees. Find the time of flight, the maximum height and the range.",
